('Cable rope overhead triceps extension','Arms','Cable','Face away from a high pulley, rope behind the head, straighten the arms overhead, return slowly.',191),
('Single-arm cable pushdown','Arms','Cable','High pulley with a handle, elbow pinned to the side, push down until the arm is straight, return slowly.',192),
('Reverse-grip cable pushdown','Arms','Cable','High pulley with a bar, palms facing up, elbows tight, push down until the arms are straight.',193),
('Close-grip push-up','Arms','Bodyweight','Hands just inside shoulder width, elbows brushing the ribs, lower the chest and press back up.',194),
('Smith close-grip press','Arms','Smith bar','Bench under the Smith bar, hands shoulder-width, lower to the lower chest and press up.',195),
('Cable triceps kickback','Arms','Cable','Low pulley, hinge forward with the elbow at the side, straighten the arm behind you, return slowly.',196),
('Bodyweight triceps extension','Arms','Bodyweight','Hands on a bar or bench at an incline, bend the elbows to lower the head towards it, straighten the arms.',197),
('Tate press','Arms','Dumbbell','Lie on a bench with dumbbells over the chest, elbows out, lower the weights to the chest by bending the elbows, press back.',198),
-- Biceps (10)
('Reverse barbell curl','Arms','Barbell','Overhand grip, elbows pinned to the sides, curl the bar up and lower slowly.',199),
('Concentration curl','Arms','Dumbbell','Seated, elbow against the inner thigh, curl the dumbbell up, squeeze, lower slowly.',200),
('Dumbbell preacher curl','Arms','Dumbbell','Upper arm flat on a bench pad, curl the dumbbell up and lower fully under control.',201),
('Zottman curl','Arms','Dumbbell','Curl up with palms facing up, turn the palms down at the top and lower slowly.',202),
('Spider curl','Arms','Dumbbell','Chest on an incline bench, arms hanging straight down, curl the dumbbells up and lower slowly.',203),
('Cable hammer curl','Arms','Cable','Low pulley with a rope, palms facing in, curl up with elbows pinned and lower slowly.',204),
('Single-arm cable curl','Arms','Cable','Low pulley with a handle, elbow at the side, curl up, squeeze, lower slowly.',205),
('Alternating dumbbell curl','Arms','Dumbbell','Curl one dumbbell at a time, turning the palm up as you lift, lower slowly before the other arm.',206),
('Cross-body hammer curl','Arms','Dumbbell','Palms facing in, curl each dumbbell across the body towards the opposite shoulder, lower slowly.',207),
('Drag curl','Arms','Barbell','Curl the bar up while sliding it along the body, elbows moving back, lower slowly.',208),
-- Chest (10)
('Decline barbell bench press','Chest','Barbell','On a decline bench, lower the bar to the lower chest with control and press it back up.',209),
('Decline dumbbell press','Chest','Dumbbell','On a decline bench, lower the dumbbells to the sides of the lower chest and press up.',210),
('Incline dumbbell fly','Chest','Dumbbell','Bench at 30 degrees, arms slightly bent, open wide to chest level, then bring the weights together.',211),
('Incline cable fly','Chest','Cable','Bench at 30 degrees between low pulleys, sweep the handles up and together over the upper chest.',212),
('Low-to-high cable fly','Chest','Cable','Pulleys low, step forward, sweep the handles up and together to chest height, return slowly.',213),
('Decline push-up','Chest','Bodyweight','Feet raised on a bench, hands under the shoulders, lower the chest to the floor and press up.',214),
('Incline push-up','Chest','Bodyweight','Hands on a bench or bar, body in a straight line, lower the chest to it and press up.',215),
('Archer push-up','Chest','Bodyweight','Wide hands, lower towards one hand while the other arm stays straight, press up, then switch sides.',216),
('Single-arm dumbbell bench press','Chest','Dumbbell','Lie on a bench with one dumbbell, brace so you do not twist, press up and lower slowly.',217),
('Squeeze press','Chest','Dumbbell','Press two dumbbells together over the chest and keep squeezing them as you lower and press.',218),
-- Back (10)
('Pendlay row','Back','Barbell','Flat back, bar on the floor each rep, pull it explosively to the lower chest and return it to the floor.',219),
('T-bar row','Back','Landmine','Straddle the bar, hinge to a flat back, row the handle to the chest and lower slowly.',220),
('Wide-grip lat pulldown','Back','Cable','Wide grip on the bar, pull to the upper chest with the elbows down and back, control the way up.',221),
('Close-grip lat pulldown','Back','Cable','Narrow handle, lean back slightly, pull to the upper chest and squeeze the lats.',222),
('Reverse-grip bent-over row','Back','Barbell','Underhand grip, hinge to a flat back, pull the bar to the lower ribs and lower slowly.',223),
('Chest-supported dumbbell row','Back','Dumbbell','Chest on an incline bench, row the dumbbells up to the hips, squeeze the shoulder blades.',224),
('Meadows row','Back','Landmine','Stand side-on to the bar end, hinge, row the end of the bar to the hip with a flat back.',225),
('Rack pull','Back','Barbell','Bar on blocks at knee height, flat back, stand tall squeezing the glutes and upper back.',226),
('Neutral-grip pull-up','Back','Pull-up bar','Palms facing each other, pull the chest to the hands, lower fully under control.',227),
('Wide-grip seated cable row','Back','Cable','Sit tall, pull the wide bar to the stomach with the elbows out, pause and return slowly.',228),
-- Legs (10)
('Barbell lunge','Legs','Barbell','Bar on the upper back, step forward, lower the back knee towards the floor and push back up.',229),
('Zercher squat','Legs','Barbell','Hold the bar in the crook of the elbows, brace, squat to depth and stand up tall.',230),
('Smith calf raise','Legs','Smith bar','Balls of the feet on a plate under the Smith bar, rise high, pause, lower for a stretch.',231),
('Single-leg calf raise','Legs','Bodyweight','Stand on one foot on a step, rise onto the toes, pause at the top and lower slowly.',232),
('Cossack squat','Legs','Bodyweight','Wide stance, shift onto one leg and squat deep while the other leg stays straight, then switch.',233),
